# MISSION

Prove that the rebuilt CAGE target for this challenge is *faithfully
exploitable*: produce an exploit under `solve/` that, run from the player's
network vantage against a freshly launched clean instance, reaches the
challenge's intended success signal (captures the flag / triggers the intended
crash or primitive). A target that boots and answers a readiness probe is NOT
yet proven — the environment is only faithful once the intended exploit works
against it.

